    "TweetText": "Introducing UIBook✨. \n\nI’ve had the same habit for years: looking at well-designed websites every day.\n\nWhenever I come across a design that stands out, I save it, break it down, and classify it by what it actually does.\n\nThat habit became UIBook.\n\nA handpicked library of real landing pages and sections, organized with unusual attention to detail.\n\nYou can browse by pattern, filter from multiple angles, or simply describe what you need with AI Search.\n\nAI has made building products easier than ever. I think that makes good references—and good design judgment—even more important.\n\nThis is the first version, and I’m going to keep building it in public.\n\nhttps://uibook.art/?utm_id=uibook_launch_20260729&utm_source=x&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=uibook_launch&utm_source_platform=x&utm_content=founder_launch_post_01\n\nI’d love to know what you think. 💙",
