    "TweetText": "Breakdown of ElevenLabs' launch video for Flows Agent\n\nFull workflow explained in just 48 seconds without feeling overwhelming\n\nHere is the 5-stage structure and why it converts:\n\n[1/5] Introduction → A prompt typed out live (\"10-second product ad...\"). It skips the fluff and grounds the product in a real work task, so viewers get what it does in 3 seconds\n\n[2/5] Set Up → Zooming in on the prompt settings while AI models get picked automatically. Instead of reading out specs, it shows the software doing the hard work in the background\n\n[3/5] How It Works → The camera zooms out to show the whole canvas. Watching the nodes visually connect makes a complex AI pipeline instantly easy to understand\n\n[4/5] Use Cases → Fast clips of changing aspect ratios, voice choices, and dubbing. It gives instant visual proof, showing marketing teams how easy it is to create variations\n\n[5/5] Call to Action → A clean ending screen asking \"What should we create next?\" It keeps the signup process feeling simple and inviting without a pushy sales pitch\n\nP.S. I produce videos like this for a living. If you have a launch coming up, book a call with me on the Flash Motion website (link in bio) or DM me",
