    "UserProfilePic": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2046883460812333057/rai6spiv_200x200.jpg",
    "TweetText": "VISUAL OS 001, in motion.\n\nWe printed CALL big enough — the macaw answered, and took the frame.\n\nThe type is the poster. Motion just changes who holds it.\n\ni2v prompt ↓",
