      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2046883460812333057/rai6spiv_200x200.jpg",
      "text": "VISUAL OS 001 — Macro Megatype\n\nThe type is the poster. The object only proves it.\n\nDesign rule: never cover your headline.\nThese 4 bury half of it — and the verb reads faster,\nbecause your brain autocompletes the blocked letters.\n\nCALL — macaw\nFOCUS — lens\nGROW — cactus\nMOVE — running shoe\n\nLocked:\n– electric blue field + print grain\n– oversized white condensed verb\n– hero crop invading from the edge\n– corner crop marks + micro labels\n– one soft mood word bottom-left\n\nSwaps: verb / subject / mood word / field code\n\nPrompt ↓",
      "url": "https://x.com/VigoCreativeAI/status/2079505806895075589",
